  "description": "Translates Cerner Millennium ENCOUNTER.ENCNTR_TYPE_CD values (CODE_VALUE rows in code set 71) to the HEALIX enterprise encounter class (v3 ActEncounterCode subset). CODE_VALUE numbers are site-specific and illustrative; the Source Registry (module 03) supplies the live set and agent.inventory refreshes the source CodeSystem from CDC. Elements with no target are intentionally absent so that $translate returns no match and the record follows the value set unmappedPolicy (quarantine). Used by the PV1[Encounter] mapping (IOP-02 §5) and reversible for outbound ADT with the consumer's code table.",
  "purpose": "Governed local-to-standard translation for Encounter.class (IOP-V2-012, IOP-TS-009).",
